package-level set, `huhyphn` (Nagy Bence) for `hyph_hu_HU.dic`, and
`dehyphn.tex` via CTAN for `hyph_de_DE.dic`. The exact bytes shipped here are
identified by size and SHA-256 in
`docs/superpowers/plans/logs/T-04.log` §2 and in
