4. Data identity
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The embedded tables are generated from the L1 bytes by a generator that lives
outside this module (see `lib/data/*.mbt` headers). The L1 files, their byte
sizes and SHA-256 digests are frozen in
`docs/superpowers/plans/logs/T-04.log` §2 and
`docs/superpowers/designs/202610201517-moon-textstat-移植-数据与门禁约定.md`
§1.2. `tools/verify_l1.py` re-checks those identities.
